  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "This is Pip. Pip is a puppy. Pip is a good puppy. Pip is small. Pip sees a pond. The pond is big. The water is blue. Pip looks at the water. Pip is not happy. Pip is scared. Water is big. Pip is very scared. Pip runs away. Pip runs fast. A boy is here.",
      "His name is Sam. Sam is a friend. Sam is a good friend. Sam has a ball. The ball is red. The ball is new. Sam throws the ball. The red ball is in the pond. Sam is happy. Sam smiles. Sam goes in the water. Sam plays in the water. Water is fun for Sam. Sam plays good. Pip sees Sam.",
      "Pip sees the red ball. The red ball is in the water. Sam is happy. Pip wants the red ball. Pip wants to play. Pip looks at the water. Pip is still scared. Pip goes in the water. Pip goes in the big water. Pip gets the ball. Pip is happy. Pip plays in the water. Water is fun for Pip. Pip is a brave puppy."
    ],
